Changes made in this fork, as required by section 5(a) of the GPL:

  - The store page headlines the cheapest price currently available across all
    selected stores, rather than the all-time historic low.
  - Added wishlist sale alerts covering every supported store, with a deals
    list page and notifications that link through to a game's store page.
  - All stores are enabled by default rather than Steam alone.
  - Provider API keys may be supplied by the user, and the credentials
    endpoint is self-hostable, removing the dependency on a single service.
  - Added a unit and integration test suite, and corrected the licence
    metadata in package.json, which declared BSD-3-Clause while the LICENSE
    file has always been GPL-3.0.

Third-party services used at runtime are documented in README.md.
